      "headline": "Equinor posts record Q1 2026 earnings as Iran war drives production and price gains",
      "summary": "Equinor reported adjusted operating income of $9.77 billion and record equity production of 2.313 million boe/day for Q1 2026, up 9% year-on-year. Profits were boosted by Iran war-driven oil and gas price surges, though a 19% drop in cash flow from operations and a miss on cash-flow forecasts sent shares lower. The company approved a $375 million second share-buyback tranche and warned Europe will not reach 80% pre-winter gas storage.",
